$ curl -i http://127.0.0.1:3000/books/13
HTTP/1.1 410 Gone
content-type: application/json
content-length: 50

{"error":"book 13 was removed from the catalogue"}

$ curl -i http://127.0.0.1:3000/books/9
HTTP/1.1 404 Not Found
content-type: application/json
content-length: 28

{"error":"book 9 not found"}

$ curl -i http://127.0.0.1:3000/books/2
HTTP/1.1 200 OK
content-type: application/json
content-length: 23

{"id":2,"title":"Emma"}
